      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀～那可真爽啊～\n就连我自己都没想到，我居然可以在比赛时兴奋成那样呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e55b4eda4c1f27557edb5e61f7366e4099ec43bb77600ebae7ad42334a482c68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
